    "body": "I think the command line argument should take precedence here, and I'd prefer a saner default and something more functional like this:\r\n```suggestion\r\n        let width = arguments\r\n            .value_of(\"terminal_width\")\r\n            .and_then(|w| w.parse().ok())\r\n            .or_else(|| terminal_size().map(|(w, _)| w.0 as usize))\r\n            .unwrap_or(80);\r\n```",
